{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18272","headline":"贺张十八秘书得裴司空马 · 韩愈","name":"贺张十八秘书得裴司空马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司空远寄养初成，毛色桃花眼镜明。\n落日已曾交辔语，春风还拟竝鞍行。\n长令奴仆知饥渴，须着贤良待性情。\n旦夕公归伸拜谢，免劳骑去逐双旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}